{"id":11561,"date":"2023-09-14T12:52:38","date_gmt":"2023-09-14T12:52:38","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/?p=11561"},"modified":"2023-09-14T12:59:44","modified_gmt":"2023-09-14T12:59:44","slug":"konference-flatlands-behind-graphene","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/konference-flatlands-behind-graphene\/","title":{"rendered":"Konference Flatlands 2023"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><span class=\"HwtZe\" lang=\"cs\"><span class=\"jCAhz ChMk0b\"><span class=\"ryNqvb\">Konference <a href=\"https:\/\/flatlands2023.com\/\"><strong>Flatlands<\/strong><\/a> je pravideln\u00e9 setk\u00e1n\u00ed, kter\u00e9 v\u011bdc\u016fm umo\u017e\u0148uje, aby se zapojili do zaj\u00edmav\u00fdch diskus\u00ed a vym\u011b\u0148ovali si nejnov\u011bj\u0161\u00ed poznatky v oblasti dvourozm\u011brn\u00fdch materi\u00e1l\u016f, a to nejen grafenu.<\/span><\/span> <span class=\"jCAhz ChMk0b\"><span class=\"ryNqvb\">To zahrnuje pokroky v synt\u00e9ze, charakterizaci a teoretick\u00e9m modelov\u00e1n\u00ed a aplikace v elektronice, skladov\u00e1n\u00ed energie, katal\u00fdze a optoelektronice.<\/span><\/span> <span class=\"jCAhz ChMk0b\"><span class=\"ryNqvb\">Nejprve se toto setk\u00e1n\u00ed konalo v n\u011bmeck\u00fdch Br\u00e9m\u00e1ch (2013) a n\u00e1sledn\u011b v irsk\u00e9m Dublinu (2014), Ramat Gan, Izrael (2015), ve m\u011bst\u011b Bled, Slovinsko (2016), v Lausanne, \u0160v\u00fdcarsko (2017), v Lipsku, N\u011bmecko (2018)<\/span><\/span> <span class=\"jCAhz ChMk0b\"><span class=\"ryNqvb\">, v Toulouse, Francie (2019), Online (2021) a na Lanzarote, \u0160pan\u011blsko (2022).<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>R\u00e1di v\u00e1s tak\u00e9 uv\u00edt\u00e1me u na\u0161eho st\u00e1nku, kde pro v\u00e1s krom\u011b jin\u00e9ho budeme m\u00edt informace o jedine\u010dn\u00e9m SNOM syst\u00e9mu <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.neaspec.com\/\">NeaScope<\/a><\/strong> a kde na v\u00e1s bude \u010dekat n\u00e1\u0161 kolega ze spole\u010dnosti Attocube, kter\u